window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From #1 bestseller Morgan Rice comes the second book in a spectacular new fantasy series, THORNHAVEN, ideal for fans of Brandon Sanderson, Rebecca Yarros, and Sarah J. Maas.</b><br> <br> As Faye Wilderpath enters her second year at Thornhaven, she delves deeper into magical studies, excelling in some disciplines while struggling with others. A series of mysterious attacks within Thornhaven leads Faye and her friends to uncover a plot involving a mysterious infiltrator, while her relationships with both Callum and Ren reach unexpected heights. Balancing her studies, two potential romances, and a deadly conspiracy, Faye must dig deep if she has any hopes of surviving the harrowing Ordeal of Shadows.<br> <br> Enter a romantasy world like nothing you’ve seen before, with an exhilarating realm filled with peril and promise. Destiny guides Faye to experiences of romance and magic while challenging her determination to endure in a saga characterized by unexpected twists and gripping excitement. It will captivate both young minds and experienced fantasy enthusiasts alike, as you fall in love and don't stop listening.<br> <br> Future books in the series are available!</p>"; 
